A||||16||Formula||Supra TT vs. Fiero Northstar TT||||1||
Z||000000||Formula||08-23-2001||10:27 AM||||Fictious Story!<BR>here we have it folks...<P>Contestant #1..<BR>A silver Toyota Supra BPU making 490 rwhp through an M6 transmission. Very nice setup. Show winning custom paint job with 17" deep dish chrome wheels. Full custom leather interior with onboard pentium 1GHZ computer control system. Everything ran by the Pentium. Voice activated controls. Stereo is ran through the computer with over 1000 mp3s, a cellular connection to Morpheus downloading all the current music at every given time. A 10.5" touch screen is used to control all of the accersories (heater, AC, winshield wipers etc...) Full Movie capacity with dolby 5.1 suround. 4 digital video cameras show onboard videos of the cars surroundings. 2 digital cameras snap pictures of other cars during races, both mounted facing the rear! The computer adjusts fuel flow and boost according to readings from all sensors. Sensor output option can be manaully changed on board for manual adjustment of motor. Will not go in limp home mode under this setup.<P>Contestant #2:<P>A Viper Red pearl Fiero with a Twin Turbocharged Aluminum Northstar V8. Stainless exhaust runs from the open headers. Twin throttlebodies come from the purple intake. Shields house the nitrous lines off the intake going into the rear trunk. This setup creates 394 hp without the 100 shot of nitrous that pushes it up to 464 hp. The full interior is from a 2000 C5 corvette with a full race cage. The 5 speed getrag with shortened shifter puts the interior at rest with the secretive n20 button inside (flip up top on shifter). The fully independant eibach suspension puts the car at a 1.16 skidpad with z rated yokohamas on 17" split 6 spoke aluminum wheels. The full space frame was recreated in aluminum to get the car down to 2300 lbs fully dressed. <P>The bet:<BR>the tall dark male supra owner weighing just over 200 lbs finds the slim blonde large busted female fiero owner in the local starbucks parking lot. The supra owner brags up his car, that definetly deserves it, to the fiero owner and bets $2000 that his car can beat hers in a 4 corners race across town. He explains the rules of the 4 corners race is the first person to reach all 4 corners in a specified order is the winner. This course through town takes them through several long straight aways but also throws them into some tight 90 degree turns. with the 3rd corner being all the way out into the countryside with a bit of traffic. The fiero owner agrees and the race is set for 8-21-01 at 7:00pm.<P>Before the Race:<BR>Both cars are dynoed at the local speedshop and the supra is by far the stronger car. but, weighing almost 1000#s less the fiero shouldnt be thrown away. The Supra got a .96g on the skidpad while the fiero far exceeded that. Both cars will run at full boost with the computer lowering the boost under to much heat or pressure. <P>The Race:<BR>Both drivers are called on their cell phones to come to the spot and told where and how to get there. The Supra gets to the start first while blasting bling bling by Big Tymers with a fresh wax and set of freshly polished rims. Off in the distance the crowd can hear the throaty idle of the northstar shaking the ground with a little bit of bump coming from a boston aucostic 10" sub under the hood. The blonde hair of the fiero driver is very visible and blows in the mild breeze as she kicks the fiero down into first and spools the turbos to life. The supra follows her lead and spools his turbos up. The crowd gasps as the fiero backfires loud and flames shoot out the exhaust. The door of the fiero opens as the luscious owner steps out and pops the decklid. After several minutes of swearing and cussing the girl jumps back in the car and starts it up and grins. Both cars stage in the parking lot spinning the $400 a piece tires and creep out onto the road at a long standing red light. The crowd looks in awe as the light turns green, the supra owner slams his shifter into first, dumps the clutch and smokes the tires up, at the same moment the fiero owner slips the clutch barely spinning the tires and stays nose to nose with the shogun front nose on the supra. The supra shifts to second first and jumps a car on the fiero which is still in its powerband. the fiero pounds second and jumps back up nose to nose with the supra. both car start to back off as a 90 degree turn is coming up fast. Out of nowhere, the fiero owner shifts it into third spools up her turbos and takes the turn at over 70 mph doing a complete powerdrift through the turn. The Supra backs up a little bit and steadily goes through the turn losing about 5 cars on the fiero. Next, they come up to a 3 mile straight stretch where the supra has time to wind out 6th gear and pass the fiero going 170 compared to the 162 of the fiero. they speed pass the first corner flag with the supra ahead by 3 tenths of a second. Both cars again slow down for the next upcoming set of twisties, the supra loses traction and runs through an old mans yard, coming within 5 feet of hitting him on a riding mower, but regains it and straightens the supra up and gets on the road right beside the speeding fiero. The next turn the fiero again does a powerslide (with a 1.16g I dont know how she did it) and pulls on the supra again. They careen past the second corner going up an onramp onto a busy section of highway. The supra easily manhandles the fiero through the whole 3rd leg and has a 5 car lead on the fiero. Coming off the offramp the fiero again drifts and then shoots the nitrous on the small straight stretch catching the supra. They run through the gears nose to nose again but the fiero uses the rest of her nitrous and burns the tires through third. They start to come up to a stop light with no cars around. both vehicles blaze through the light and the familiar sound and sight of a police cruizer is behind them. neither owner slows down and they head into the last set of twisties rapidly accelerating from the crown vic. after blowing away the cop, both cars get back into business with the fiero leading into the last straight. With a big suprise, the supra purges at over 100 mphs and uses a shot of cheater nitrous to pull a nose on the fiero. The 2 cars stay this way while passing the finish and the supra takes the win! <P>afterwards:<BR>The supra owner denies taking money from the fiero owner and offers a handshake. instead the fiero gives the supra owner a kiss with a lot of tongue, and both come out smiling.<P>the end...<P>btw... not a true story<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigformulagt.jpg"> ||||reg||1
