Z||000013||MinnGreenGT||08-24-2001||04:47 PM||||Hey guys- you ever hear of fiction? The point of the story was to be entertaining, not factually correct.  Ever see Fast & Furious?  Think everything in there was real? I hope not, you're car guys.  Anyway- if you want facts, watch a documentary.  Want entertainment? Watch a movie, or read this story... not flaming, just don't feel like nitpickin' a fun story.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg"> <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
